{title: Great in Power}
{song_number: 46}
{language: en}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[D]Praise Him, you heavens and all that's above!
[D]Praise Him, you angels and heavenly hosts!
[G]Let the whole earth [D]praise Him!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[D]Praise Him, the sun, moon and bright shining stars!
[D]Praise Him, you heavens and waters and skies!
[G]Let the whole earth [D]praise Him!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[D]Great in [Dmaj7]power [Bm]and great in [Bm7]glory!
[G]Great in mercy, [Bm]King of Heaven!
[Bm]Great in [A]battle, [D]great in [Dmaj7]wonder,
[Bm]great in [Bm7]Zion, [G]King over [A]all the [D]earth.
{end_of_chorus}
